{"parentUuid":"0f24453d-e9c4-4deb-93e8-a05426b6f8ff","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"47ecdd8a-ca00-4576-a9bb-909e9e5db54c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VSYKZc2LDfv1ynxxoeQ86g","type":"tool_result","content":"=== session current ===\nNo active session found in this worktree.\n=== session attach --help ===\nAttach an existing agent session that wasn't captured by hooks.\n\nThis creates a checkpoint from the session's transcript and links it to the\nlast commit. Use this when hooks failed to fire or weren't installed when\nthe session started, or to attach a research session.\n\nIf the last commit already has a checkpoint, the session is added to it.\nOtherwise a new checkpoint is created.\n\nUse --review to tag the attached session as an agent review. The\nfirst user prompt in the transcript is recorded as the review prompt.\nPass --skills to declare which skills were actually run; omit to\nattach a review without a declared skills list.\n\nWorks with any registered agent, including external agents enabled via\nexternal_agents in settings. Run 'entire agent list' to see the full list.\n\nIf --agent doesn't locate a transcript, Entire auto-detects the agent from\nthe transcript and prints the detected agent name.\n\nUsage:\n  entire session attach <session-id> [flags]\nShell cwd was reset to /home/utkuputku/Desktop/Umbra","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"f98b8fad-65b9-4dbc-b98e-70f19dc9490f","timestamp":"2026-09-06T04:37:56.647Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"=== session current ===\nNo active session found in this worktree.\n=== session attach --help ===\nAttach an existing agent session that wasn't captured by hooks.\n\nThis creates a checkpoint from the session's transcript and links it to the\nlast commit. Use this when hooks failed to fire or weren't installed when\nthe session started, or to attach a research session.\n\nIf the last commit already has a checkpoint, the session is added to it.\nOtherwise a new checkpoint is created.\n\nUse --review to tag the attached session as an agent review. The\nfirst user prompt in the transcript is recorded as the review prompt.\nPass --skills to declare which skills were actually run; omit to\nattach a review without a declared skills list.\n\nWorks with any registered agent, including external agents enabled via\nexternal_agents in settings. Run 'entire agent list' to see the full list.\n\nIf --agent doesn't locate a transcript, Entire auto-detects the agent from\nthe transcript and prints the detected agent name.\n\nUsage:\n  entire session attach <session-id> [flags]","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/utkuputku/Desktop/Umbra","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0f24453d-e9c4-4deb-93e8-a05426b6f8ff","session_id":"abbf9c0c-4f5e-46cd-a7be-70d09966a014","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/utkuputku/Desktop/Umbra","sessionId":"8017734d-cdf6-4a18-b2f8-f4b5f637ec35","version":"2.1.261","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkling-waddling-dragon"}
