{"parentUuid":"98c6d246-a79e-42b1-a7cd-78c69f13e816","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"47ecdd8a-ca00-4576-a9bb-909e9e5db54c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013FhZhqgCLPXWtR1V7FJtZH","type":"tool_result","content":"![entire-graph theme](docs/images/gh-repo-cover.png \"entire-graph cover image\")\n\n# Entire Graph\n\nCoding agents lose time before the edit, while they are still looking for the\nright code. Entire Graph is a plugin for the Entire CLI that gives an agent a\nprecomputed map of one Git repository: ranked code search plus definitions,\ncallers, types, routes, and change impact, each with `file:line` locations. The\nbuilt-in analyzer parses the repository locally with tree-sitter and makes no\nnetwork requests, model calls, or API-key lookups. Installing the plugin is the\nnetworked step.\n\n=== ... ===\n3:# Entire Graph\n18:## Benchmarks\n67:## Install\n102:## Activate it for your agent\n125:## Ask your first question\n197:## What to ask\n212:## Working tree and cache\n240:## Limits\nShell cwd was reset to /home/utkuputku/Desktop/Umbra","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d8e0f881-9c5e-4454-8e7a-4a10abfe83ef","timestamp":"2026-09-06T04:46:35.069Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"![entire-graph theme](docs/images/gh-repo-cover.png \"entire-graph cover image\")\n\n# Entire Graph\n\nCoding agents lose time before the edit, while they are still looking for the\nright code. Entire Graph is a plugin for the Entire CLI that gives an agent a\nprecomputed map of one Git repository: ranked code search plus definitions,\ncallers, types, routes, and change impact, each with `file:line` locations. The\nbuilt-in analyzer parses the repository locally with tree-sitter and makes no\nnetwork requests, model calls, or API-key lookups. Installing the plugin is the\nnetworked step.\n\n=== ... ===\n3:# Entire Graph\n18:## Benchmarks\n67:## Install\n102:## Activate it for your agent\n125:## Ask your first question\n197:## What to ask\n212:## Working tree and cache\n240:## Limits","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/utkuputku/Desktop/Umbra","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"98c6d246-a79e-42b1-a7cd-78c69f13e816","session_id":"abbf9c0c-4f5e-46cd-a7be-70d09966a014","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/utkuputku/Desktop/Umbra","sessionId":"8017734d-cdf6-4a18-b2f8-f4b5f637ec35","version":"2.1.261","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkling-waddling-dragon"}
