{"parentUuid":"a459b8d8-2dd8-49cd-b8f6-6e20866739e5","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"47ecdd8a-ca00-4576-a9bb-909e9e5db54c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01L6uVRsC2tEx5XcYXEqGJ1i","type":"tool_result","content":"## Development record\n\nUmbra was built in a standalone repository, `u7k4rs6/Umbra`, rather than inside\na fork of `entireio/entire-graph`. The `umbra/` layout from ARCHITECTURE.md was\npreserved exactly so the module can be grafted into a fork without moving a\nfile, and `scripts/graft.sh` does that graft, with a dry run, without pushing.\nThe build's own checkpoint trail lives in this repository under\n`refs/entire/checkpoints/`, and the phase by phase record is the table at the\ntop of [NOTES.md](NOTES.md), which covers all seventeen phases and\ncarries what each one found and where the design documents turned out to be\nwrong.\n\nSeventeen phases, of which the first thirteen built the product. The last four\nwere not features:\n\n- **14** replaced the landing page's scripted sample with a real run, added a\n  second map from an imported session in another project, and prepared two\n  scripts that were deliberately not executed: the graft, and a read-only audit\n  of what the checkpoint refs on the remote contain.\nShell cwd was reset to /home/utkuputku/Desktop/Umbra","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"6961a98a-e936-40c3-a49e-a7760aa0af9e","timestamp":"2026-09-06T04:47:40.147Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"## Development record\n\nUmbra was built in a standalone repository, `u7k4rs6/Umbra`, rather than inside\na fork of `entireio/entire-graph`. The `umbra/` layout from ARCHITECTURE.md was\npreserved exactly so the module can be grafted into a fork without moving a\nfile, and `scripts/graft.sh` does that graft, with a dry run, without pushing.\nThe build's own checkpoint trail lives in this repository under\n`refs/entire/checkpoints/`, and the phase by phase record is the table at the\ntop of [NOTES.md](NOTES.md), which covers all seventeen phases and\ncarries what each one found and where the design documents turned out to be\nwrong.\n\nSeventeen phases, of which the first thirteen built the product. The last four\nwere not features:\n\n- **14** replaced the landing page's scripted sample with a real run, added a\n  second map from an imported session in another project, and prepared two\n  scripts that were deliberately not executed: the graft, and a read-only audit\n  of what the checkpoint refs on the remote contain.","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/utkuputku/Desktop/Umbra","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a459b8d8-2dd8-49cd-b8f6-6e20866739e5","session_id":"abbf9c0c-4f5e-46cd-a7be-70d09966a014","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/utkuputku/Desktop/Umbra","sessionId":"8017734d-cdf6-4a18-b2f8-f4b5f637ec35","version":"2.1.261","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkling-waddling-dragon"}
