{"parentUuid":"df94b7d1-794c-4a5b-8f47-a9ff6c294821","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cemid1yP79AkjG5nwtVu9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"My own session's transcript isn't on disk, and the only `entire-graph` transcript (`4c5862c2`, 11:36) is from the session that ended before I started. Attaching it would claim my commits came from that session, which is false. Proceeding without trailers and reporting it rather than misattributing. Committing task 2."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1504,"cache_read_input_tokens":898231,"output_tokens":1485,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":485},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1504,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":3,"output_tokens":1485,"cache_read_input_tokens":898231,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1504,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1504},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CemicsSvHSPBhFBn5nRz8","type":"assistant","uuid":"0f434afe-8272-44fa-bdc3-45f63a767135","timestamp":"2026-09-06T06:33:04.097Z","effort":"high","session_id":"abbf9c0c-4f5e-46cd-a7be-70d09966a014","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/utkuputku/Desktop/Umbra","sessionId":"8017734d-cdf6-4a18-b2f8-f4b5f637ec35","version":"2.1.261","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkling-waddling-dragon"}
{"parentUuid":"0f434afe-8272-44fa-bdc3-45f63a767135","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cemid1yP79AkjG5nwtVu9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01D5o8JLBkqrfyVewxPdrwFf","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/utkuputku/entire-graph\ngit add umbra/internal/transcript/claudecode.go umbra/internal/transcript/failed_read_test.go umbra/internal/transcript/testdata/failed-read.jsonl\ngit -c commit.gpgsign=false commit -q -F - <<'MSG'\numbra: a failed read no longer marks a node lit\n\nThe parser records a Read when the tool call is made, which is before the\nresult comes back, and it never looked at tool_result.is_error. A read of a\npath that does not exist therefore landed in the examined set exactly like a\nsuccessful one, and the node it named came out lit.\n\nThat is the worst direction for this tool to be wrong in. Umbra exists to say\nwhat the session did not look at, and this made it report code as inspected\nthat the session never saw.\n\nEach tool_use is now paired with its tool_result through the id both already\ncarry, and a read whose result came back is_error is dropped. The drop happens\nafter the scan rather than during it, because the pending map holds pointers\ninto the event slice.\n\nThis can only ever move a node toward shadow, never away from it: it removes\nevidence of inspection and never adds any. The fix is deliberately narrow. It\ndrops failed reads only, not every failed tool call, because reads are what the\nreview named and a wider change under time pressure is how a second bug gets\nintroduced.\n\nKnown-positive, in internal/transcript/failed_read_test.go with a fixture in\ntestdata/failed-read.jsonl holding one read that succeeded and one that\nreturned is_error. It asserts the successful read survives, the errored one\ndoes not, and that exactly one read remains.\n\nProved by reverting. With the filter disabled the test fails with:\n  a read that returned is_error was kept as evidence of inspection:\n  {Seq:4 Kind:read Path:app/missing.py ToolID:bad1}\n  expected exactly one surviving read, got 2\n  app/missing.py failed to read and must stay in shadow\nRestored, it passes.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Gqxi2oeEAPrkQtZqBPR6dP\nMSG\necho \"exit=$?\"; git log -1 --format='%h %s'\nexport PATH=\"$HOME/.local/share/mise/installs/go/1.26.3/bin:$PATH\"\ncd umbra && go build -o \"$HOME/.local/bin/entire-umbra\" ./cmd/entire-umbra && echo \"binary rebuilt with both fixes\"","description":"Commit task 2 and rebuild the binary"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1504,"cache_read_input_tokens":898231,"output_tokens":1485,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":485},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1504,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":3,"output_tokens":1485,"cache_read_input_tokens":898231,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1504,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1504},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CemicsSvHSPBhFBn5nRz8","type":"assistant","uuid":"15872748-435c-460f-8987-67f6b3f7ee7b","timestamp":"2026-09-06T06:33:15.360Z","effort":"high","session_id":"abbf9c0c-4f5e-46cd-a7be-70d09966a014","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/utkuputku/Desktop/Umbra","sessionId":"8017734d-cdf6-4a18-b2f8-f4b5f637ec35","version":"2.1.261","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkling-waddling-dragon"}
