{"parentUuid":"b351d521-06da-4822-b4db-8ebb9fddd895","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CemkUiwhx2UMrtaqCTLgX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All times IST, 6 September 2026.\n\n## My four commits from this session\n\n| Time | SHA | Task |\n|---|---|---|\n| 12:01:59 | `1eaad486` | 1. Sweep never reports a false zero |\n| 12:03:17 | `b4134ca4` | 2. Failed read no longer marks a node lit |\n| 12:04:19 | `97dd8d7b` | 3. Document what the design describes and the binary does not do |\n| 12:05:34 | `dfefa42e` | 4. Record the external review in BUILDATHON.md |\n\nSpread: **3 minutes 35 seconds**, gaps of 78s, 62s and 75s.\n\nWorth being clear about what those timestamps mean, since they look suspiciously fast for four tasks. They record when each commit was *written*, not when the work was done. Session start was 11:49. The roughly 12 minutes between then and the first commit is where nearly all of it happened: reading the two documents, locating the four leak render sites, writing both fixes, writing both known-positive tests, and running each one twice to prove it fails on revert. The commits themselves came in a burst at the end because I staged the four disjoint file sets and committed them back to back once the suite was green.\n\nThe one caveat is that the full suite did not run between each of those four commits. It ran green before the burst and again after, and each task touches a disjoint file set, but \"green before every commit\" was satisfied by bracketing rather than by four separate runs.\n\n## The earlier commits, from prior sessions\n\n| Time | SHA | |\n|---|---|---|\n| 10:07:15 | `d25e5b51` | initial understanding and intended architecture |\n| 10:18:27 | `42f215f8` | import the plugin as one commit |\n| 10:36:48 | `57cea764` | BUILDATHON.md, and restore a deny rule the graft dropped |\n| 10:49:50 | `a4b506be` | fixture baseline before the seeded signature change |\n| 10:50:35 | `6dea614c` | seed the fixture signature change |\n| 11:29:21 | `47bc2411` | point the end to end tests and the README at this repository |\n| 11:30:02 | `a49f2ea1` | stable state at the deadline |\n\nTotal span of the branch: **10:07 to 12:05**, just under two hours across three sessions. The two 45-second pairs (10:49/10:50 and 11:29/11:30) are the same pattern as mine, a staged pair committed together."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":882,"cache_read_input_tokens":918110,"output_tokens":815,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":882,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":3,"output_tokens":815,"cache_read_input_tokens":918110,"cache_creation_input_tokens":882,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":882},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CemkUbaCg1A3uFoteevVK","type":"assistant","uuid":"feb2fef1-6f63-4271-bfbe-c6380b46a765","timestamp":"2026-09-06T06:57:28.260Z","effort":"high","session_id":"abbf9c0c-4f5e-46cd-a7be-70d09966a014","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/utkuputku/Desktop/Umbra","sessionId":"8017734d-cdf6-4a18-b2f8-f4b5f637ec35","version":"2.1.261","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkling-waddling-dragon"}
