{"parentUuid":"45ba57ba-fb7a-418c-936b-9bb35eb31972","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"4b77f544-486a-4637-872d-89917842f0a2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UPFuKe3G4oqHFqeh4oJ13s","type":"tool_result","content":"=== what a judge reads about where this was built ===\numbra/HANDOFF.md:16:The work was built in a separate repository over nineteen phases, each one a\numbra/HANDOFF.md:18:one. That repository's history and its checkpoint trail are not carried across.\nBUILDATHON.md:166:repository's history, which was deliberately not carried across. Four\numbra/README.md:111:in, and that history was deliberately not carried across the graft, so the\numbra/README.md:511:Umbra was built in a standalone repository and then grafted into this fork of\n\n=== is the submission self-contained? any link needing the private repo ===\nShell cwd was reset to /home/utkuputku/Desktop/Umbra","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"6c777d45-6f80-4b86-8cb7-d3b92dbeb917","timestamp":"2026-09-06T07:30:56.160Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"=== what a judge reads about where this was built ===\numbra/HANDOFF.md:16:The work was built in a separate repository over nineteen phases, each one a\numbra/HANDOFF.md:18:one. That repository's history and its checkpoint trail are not carried across.\nBUILDATHON.md:166:repository's history, which was deliberately not carried across. Four\numbra/README.md:111:in, and that history was deliberately not carried across the graft, so the\numbra/README.md:511:Umbra was built in a standalone repository and then grafted into this fork of\n\n=== is the submission self-contained? any link needing the private repo ===","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/utkuputku/Desktop/Umbra","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"45ba57ba-fb7a-418c-936b-9bb35eb31972","session_id":"abbf9c0c-4f5e-46cd-a7be-70d09966a014","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/utkuputku/Desktop/Umbra","se