{"parentUuid":"ff2174f2-4162-4f9f-a4d5-50e0224f5a6f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cemov28cXANxBev2yEmjV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01RZLZwBUEiiim3Vakp69S42","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/utkuputku/entire-graph\ngit add umbra/README.md BUILDATHON.md\ngit -c commit.gpgsign=false commit -q -F - <<'MSG'\numbra: correct the install path and the checkpoint trail\n\nTwo documentation claims that were wrong, both found by checking rather than\nby reading.\n\nGO INSTALL DOES NOT WORK FOR THIS MODULE\n\nThe README said to run go install with @main. main tracks upstream and has no\numbra/ directory, so that path 404s. Pointing it at umbra-buildathon, where\nthe code is, was the obvious fix and it is also wrong: the module carries no\ntagged version, so the deprecation lookup fails.\n\n  go: loading deprecation for github.com/u7k4rs6/entire-graph/umbra:\n      no matching versions for query \"latest\"\n\nBoth the branch form and an explicit commit SHA were run and both failed the\nsame way. The README now gives clone and build, which is the path every run in\nthis project has actually used, and quotes the failure so nobody restores the\ngo install line believing it works.\n\nThe first fix committed an hour ago was itself unverified. Changing @main to\n@umbra-buildathon looked right and was not tested until after it was written\ndown, which is exactly the class of finding the external review raised five\ntimes over.\n\nTHE CHECKPOINT SECTION UNDERSOLD AND MISSTATED THE TRAIL\n\nIt said three commits carry no checkpoint. Seven do: the three graft commits\nand the four made in response to the external review, all from a session bound\nto a different worktree.\n\nIt also listed four checkpoints when thirteen of the twenty commits carry a\ntrailer, covered by nine distinct checkpoints, and the curveball work was\nabsent from the table entirely.\n\nThe section now shows that the cause is the worktree and not the work: three\nlater commits from the same session, made once a session was live in this\nworktree, do carry trailers. Same author, same afternoon, same kind of change.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Gqxi2oeEAPrkQtZqBPR6dP\nMSG\necho \"exit=$?\"; git status --short | head -2; echo \"(blank=clean)\"\nexport PATH=\"$HOME/.local/share/mise/installs/go/1.26.3/bin:$PATH\"\ncd umbra && go test -count=1 ./... 2>&1 | grep -E \"^(FAIL|ok)\" | grep FAIL || echo \"ALL GREEN\"","description":"Commit items 3 and 4, verify tests"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1667,"cache_read_input_tokens":964227,"output_tokens":901,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1667,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":3,"output_tokens":901,"cache_read_input_tokens":964227,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1667,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1667},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cemouq8piy2HpkWpSkNY4","type":"assistant","uuid":"9ba85aa3-81c1-40f6-aa14-308e1f20c11c","timestamp":"2026-09-06T07:42:34.117Z","effort":"high","session_id":"abbf9c0c-4f5e-46cd-a7be-70d09966a014","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/utkuputku/Desktop/Umbra","sessionId":"8017734d-cdf6-4a18-b2f8-f4b5f637ec35","version":"2.1.261","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkling-waddling-dragon"}
