{"parentUuid":"6d46835e-9f45-4a2a-a8ee-b9e3bf3cd5a7","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"87aba2de-de35-4ff1-9e3a-cbed7d26b95f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014bpXVNUnEAez1NjZUcyirX","type":"tool_result","content":"=== README 485-500 ===\n/umbra-out/\n```\n\nThe seven files were then committed, and the thing that should have been done\nlong before was done at last:\n\n```\ngit clone . /tmp/clone && cd /tmp/clone/umbra\ngo build ./...   # OK\ngo test ./...    # every package ok\n```\n\nThat clone is the verification. Before the fix it would have failed to build,\nbecause `package main` did not exist in the repository. After it, it builds and\nevery test passes, which is the only evidence that means anything here.\n\n=== BUILDATHON 725,740 ===\nentire plugin install \"$(go env GOBIN)/entire-graph\" --force\nentire graph version\n\n# umbra\ncd umbra\ngo build -o \"$HOME/.local/bin/entire-umbra\" ./cmd/entire-umbra\ngo test ./...\n\n# the fixture, then a run\ncd fixtures/app && ./setup.sh && cd ../..\n. umbra/fixtures/app/.venv/bin/activate\nentire umbra HEAD --test \"pytest -v\" --out ./out\nopen ./out/umbra.html\n```\n\nUse `pytest -v`, never `pytest -q`. Quiet mode prints no per-test ids, so\nShell cwd was reset to /home/utkuputku/Desktop/Umbra","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"b9903842-3437-4eca-8b2a-07d4747760fc","timestamp":"2026-09-06T08:02:04.249Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"=== README 485-500 ===\n/umbra-out/\n```\n\nThe seven files were then committed, and the thing that should have been done\nlong before was done at last:\n\n```\ngit clone . /tmp/clone && cd /tmp/clone/umbra\ngo build ./...   # OK\ngo test ./...    # every package ok\n```\n\nThat clone is the verification. Before the fix it would have failed to build,\nbecause `package main` did not exist in the repository. After it, it builds and\nevery test passes, which is the only evidence that means anything here.\n\n=== BUILDATHON 725,740 ===\nentire plugin install \"$(go env GOBIN)/entire-graph\" --force\nentire graph version\n\n# umbra\ncd umbra\ngo build -o \"$HOME/.local/bin/entire-umbra\" ./cmd/entire-umbra\ngo test ./...\n\n# the fixture, then a run\ncd fixtures/app && ./setup.sh && cd ../..\n. umbra/fixtures/app/.venv/bin/activate\nentire umbra HEAD --test \"pytest -v\" --out ./out\nopen ./out/umbra.html\n```\n\nUse `pytest -v`, never `pytest -q`. Quiet mode prints no per-test ids, so","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/utkuputku/Desktop/Umbra","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6d46835e-9f45-4a2a-a8ee-b9e3bf3cd5a7","session_id":"abbf9c0c-4f5e-46cd-a7be-70d09966a014","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/utkuputku/Desktop/Umbra","sessionId":"8017734d-cdf6-4a18-b2f8-f4b5f637ec35","version":"2.1.261","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkling-waddling-dragon"}
